@viz-js/viz 3.29.0
https://github.com/mdaines/viz-js/tree/96be4ed32789125f00cffa3ae390bd8809fc9c03

The GraphViz-family Worker vendors the Emscripten backend, wrapper, and
WebAssembly payload from @viz-js/viz 3.29.0. The backend is mechanically
adapted to import graphviz.wasm as a Cloudflare CompiledWasm module instead of
embedding the bytes in JavaScript. The package provenance identifies:

- GraphViz 15.1.1, source:
  https://gitlab.com/graphviz/graphviz/-/tree/15.1.1
- Expat 2.8.1, source:
  https://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/tree/R_2_8_1
- Emscripten SDK 5.0.5

GraphViz and Bytefield are licensed under EPL-2.0. The repository's shared full
EPL-2.0 text is included at licenses/bytefield-license.txt. Expat and Viz.js
use the MIT terms reproduced below.

The corresponding GraphViz 15.1.1 source is available from the exact source
link above. DiagramZip's mechanically adapted wrapper and Wasm import bridge
are retained in this repository beside the artifact and Worker source.

